The targeted harness covers first claim, same-owner re-entry, cross-owner conflict, token-mismatched release, release/reclaim recovery, queue start/end ordering, and exception rollback. Repository checks remain the source of truth for runtime-core types, scoped lint, harness validate/dry-run, comms replay/compare, credential scanning, and SHA256SUMS readback.
